  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1802.07 Purchaser",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1802.07 “Purchaser” means any person receiving a package or packaging component directly from the manufacturer or supplier of the package or packaging component who then sells or distributes the package or packaging component to a retail consumer.\n\nSource. #7343, eff 8-12-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1800); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3502.07); ss by #10601, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
